{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01S41eGQXfU6fzWqp6xdr1wy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tThe bootstrap-and-onboard action for the `rhai-innovation` collection failed on two aarch64 jobs (cpu and cuda12.9 variants) when an HTTP connection was severed mid-transfer during package resolution, producing an `IncompleteRead` error:\n2\t\n3\t```error\n4\tL3582: 00:22:18 ERROR ('Connection broken: IncompleteRead(228449 bytes read, 185764 more expected)', IncompleteRead(228449 bytes read, 185764 more expected))\n5\t```\n6\t\n7\t```error\n8\tL5526: 00:30:08 ERROR ('Connection broken: IncompleteRead(1144989 bytes read, 344486 more expected)', IncompleteRead(1144989 bytes read, 344486 more expected))\n9\t```\n10\t\n11\tThe error terminated the bootstrap process immediately with no retry, triggering cleanup (nginx shutdown) and job failure.\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f25d16b-eaaa-4417-a36e-22ff81e83b39","uuid":"b69eb041-f6f7-4084-848a-c5ea45565fed","timestamp":"2026-07-20T21:55:10.528Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jlarkin/Dev/pipeline-skills/eval/cases-rca/case-001-transient-network-failure/sections-reference/error-overview.md","content":"The bootstrap-and-onboard action for the `rhai-innovation` collection failed on two aarch64 jobs (cpu and cuda12.9 variants) when an HTTP connection was severed mid-transfer during package resolution, producing an `IncompleteRead` error:\n\n```error\nL3582: 00:22:18 ERROR ('Connection broken: IncompleteRead(228449 bytes read, 185764 more expected)', IncompleteRead(228449 bytes read, 185764 more expected))\n```\n\n```error\nL5526: 00:30:08 ERROR ('Connection broken: IncompleteRead(1144989 bytes read, 344486 more expected)', IncompleteRead(1144989 bytes read, 344486 more expected))\n```\n\nThe error terminated the bootstrap process immediately with no retry, triggering cleanup (nginx shutdown) and job failure.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
